+-- slate bands, a bustled waist with a black bow behind, and the upper skirt
+-- in two tiers hung from the thighs, its overskirt hemed in slate. The skirt
+-- panels are wide and set to the outside of each thigh so the two legs' panels
+-- meet into one full skirt standing, and part as they stride.
